              <br />
              <span className="text-text-muted/50" style={{ fontStyle: 'italic' }}>
                三分钟，照见你还没说出口的自己
              </span>
            </p>

            <Link
              href="/jueti/test"
              className="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-10 py-4 rounded-full text-white font-medium text-base transition-all duration-300 hover:brightness-110 hover:scale-[1.02]"
              style={{
                background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #8b7355, #b09a78)',
                boxShadow: '0 8px 32px rgba(139,115,85,0.25)',
